      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOVA CENTAURI (4) profiles as the horse to beat after driving home to win a Benchmark 74 at Scone by 2.6L as favourite. Her runs either side of the G3 Tibbie Stakes were superb and despite coming back in trip, she can repeat the dose with a repeat of her latest figures. HELLCIBELL (2) is the immediate danger off a neck second in BM82 grade at Tamworth and her 1280m record is a major asset, particularly with proven track-and-trip form. Bounced back last start on the quick turnaround and can go one better this time without surprising. NAVY STEEL (3) was disappointing behind NOVA CENTAURI at Scone, but the weight drop, quick turnaround give him a genuine rebound case. IMATRUESTAR (1) is the fresh runner to respect, returning from a long absence after a Taree trial win. Drawn well and is worth keeping safe. UNREACHABLE (7) gets a big chance to correct her recent form in this race.",
